      "role": "user",
      "content": "120-180mg of tylenol?? i just looked at the bottle and for his weight it says the dose should be much lower, like like 5-7ml of the liquid. i'm so confused. and you're saying the stiff neck is just a \"minor cold\"? he's literally groaning when i try to move him and he seems so confused... if those spots aren't fading it sounds like something really bad like meningitis. are you 100% sure i don't need to call 911? i'm terrified of giving him the wrong amount of meds and making it worse or if i'm just being paranoid about the hospital.",
